{"words": [{"text": "فَبَدَّلَ", "translation": "But changed"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "ظَلَمُوا۟", "translation": "wronged"}, {"text": "قَوْلًا", "translation": "(the) word"}, {"text": "غَيْرَ", "translation": "other (than)"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "(that) which"}, {"text": "قِيلَ", "translation": "was said"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "فَأَنزَلْنَا", "translation": "so We sent down"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "upon"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "ظَلَمُوا۟", "translation": "wronged"}, {"text": "رِجْزًۭا", "translation": "a punishment"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَآءِ", "translation": "the sky"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "because"}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "translation": "they were"}, {"text": "يَفْسُقُونَ", "translation": "defiantly disobeying"}], "sahih": "But those who wronged changed [those words] to a statement other than that which had been said to them, so We sent down upon those who wronged a punishment [i.e., plague] from the sky because they were defiantly disobeying."}